{"games":[{"id":122165169258616,"name":"[CARRY!] Swiss Mountain: Saxer Lücke","desc":"The Saxer lücke is a 1,650M above sea level pass in the Alpstein Mountains between the Swiss cantons of Appenzell Innerrhoden and St. Gallen . It forms a north-south connection between the Schwende-Rüte district and the municipality of Sennwald in the St. Gallen Rhine Valley .\n\n🛠️The cable car is temporarily remove because it has not been optimized.\n⚠️Not recommended for low end devices, because it includes a showcase map that displays realistic visuals.","path":"/game/122165169258616-swiss-mountain-saxer-lucke","slug":"122165169258616-swiss-mountain-saxer-lucke","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6c9fefd733c6f549e9bc33b19a69996037401d1998b197d14b0d6d1a93c04db2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ee0ca52233731e1cfdd3dc6fa2adbd3d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":6948042,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-18T20:31:32.331Z","creator":{"name":"Edelweizz World","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":81149093702516,"name":"[ Nel Isagi ] Тестовая игра My Blue Lock","desc":"This game was inspired by: \"Blue Lock/Anime\" \"Goalbound\" \"Azure Latch\" \"Footbolt\"\n-----------------------------------------\n---Controls---\nKick - (M1)\nSlide - (Q)\nDribble - (E)\nRequest ball - (R)\n---------------\n\"In this game, I'm attempting to largely replicate gameplay mechanics from the great game «Azure Latch»\"\n\n\n\n","path":"/game/81149093702516-my-blue-lock","slug":"81149093702516-my-blue-lock","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/5039d7bc97453061d7f10682497a3b23524a49bda134ba88731fa30c8f02cc5f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-14b7354d1b449e26fbe75a686adba6fc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":1668107,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-18T06:43:39.049Z","creator":{"name":"Natural_Player13","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCou